# Fights for timing at the wide river east of the castle (the scene that
# reached 7-13 fps): from a save with the sword, east along the moat's river
# to its bank, then swing in every direction for ~30 s. Needs a save past the
# sword (SAVES=). No shots, so it runs with DUMP=0; tests/phys_frames.py and
# tests/frame_costs.py read its PS3_FTRACE file.
log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
press START
sleep 3
press START
sleep 5
press CROSS
sleep 15
hold RIGHT 4
hold DOWN 1.5
hold RIGHT 3
hold RIGHT 4
hold RIGHT 4
hold RIGHT 2.5
hold UP 1.5
hold RIGHT 2

hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
sleep 10
